WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.525
BEFORE. Litter on a floor and near a drain.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.717
CLEAN. Sweep safe paper litter into a bin.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.888
CHECK. Remove standing water with adult help.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.888
AFTER. Neat room with fresh air through windows.
